WEBVTT

00:08:29.183 --> 00:08:31.183
(Laughter)

00:08:32.593 --> 00:08:35.174
I'm running out of time,
so I'm actually going to stop.

00:08:35.198 --> 00:08:36.976
I can show this to you later.

00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:40.283
But let's see if I can very quickly
get into the book spiral,

00:08:40.307 --> 00:08:42.371
because I think it's,
as I said, the most --

00:08:42.395 --> 00:08:45.712
this is the main reading room --
the most unique part of the building.

00:08:46.768 --> 00:08:47.934
You dizzy yet?

00:08:49.141 --> 00:08:50.966
Ok, so here, this is the book spiral.

00:08:56.395 --> 00:08:58.328
So, it's very indiscernible,

00:08:58.352 --> 00:09:01.853
but it's actually
a continuous stair-stepping.